WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.860
Open ZOOKA-AI, and start from your workspace.

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:09.880
Create an agent: name it, write its instructions, and pick the model.

3
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:17.340
Connect a tool like Gmail. You approve on Google's own page, and the tokens are stored encrypted.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.840
Choose the tools the agent may use, and schedule the task to run on time.

5
00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:29.540
The agent works step by step, and every step is visible to you.

6
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:35.080
Before anything sensitive, it comes back to you to review the result and approve.

7
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:43.160
Developers connect over MCP: seven tools, and every call is metered on the token wallet.

8
00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:50.020
ZOOKA-AI. Start your workspace at zooka-ai.com
